  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "4:32 AM",
      "text": "They didn’t say we could. Just that they are keeping everything clean lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:42 AM",
      "text": "That’s bad"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:44 AM",
      "text": "2 basketball people had the virus at LCA"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "8:45 AM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:46 AM",
      "text": "I mean what do I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:46 AM",
      "text": "I just hear Lions and Pistons being told to work from home"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:47 AM",
      "text": "But nope, not the others...some at the place it happened"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "8:47 AM",
      "text": "They passed out tubes of Clorox wipes last week and were like good luck"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "8:48 AM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:29 AM",
      "text": "Do you think it’s not a big deal?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:29 AM",
      "text": "Them having you work from the office"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "11:54 AM",
      "text": "I think it’s dumb that they think it’s ok to cancel all the events, but the employees still have to be here. We should be working from home to limit the risk"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "11:54 AM",
      "text": "How are you feeling about all of this?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:56 AM",
      "text": "I think it’s kinda crazy"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "12:01 PM",
      "text": "What a year this week has been"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:04 PM",
      "text": "I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "We finally got it!"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "we are now allowed to work from home"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "Wow!"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "(Starting Monday)"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:17 PM",
      "text": "Pshhh"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:17 PM",
      "text": "They should let people go home right now. I was shocked they even played a baseball game here yesterday"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:17 PM",
      "text": "An exhibition game with a bunch of old people... crazy"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "12:23 PM",
      "text": "Oh noooo"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "1:19 PM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "2:25 PM",
      "text": "If Chris Ilitch wrote jokes ..."
